    <div class="shell section-heading"><h2>Where I am going</h2><div><p>I want to work on meaningful biological questions through data, computation, and carefully designed validation. I am especially interested in environments where I can continue learning, contribute to collaborative research, and build analyses or tools that help scientists make better decisions.</p><div class="link-row"><a class="button-link" href="/research">View research</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Contact me</a></div></div></div>
